      "content": "Here is a draft statement for your website: \"We are currently addressing a minor, routine technical irregularity within our server infrastructure. Please be assured that our dedicated security teams have detected and contained the issue immediately. We want to emphatically confirm that our rigorous security protocols remain fully operational, and there has been no compromise of any sensitive customer data whatsoever.\" This phrasing focuses on control and uses definitive language to preempt detailed inquiry.",
